00:47:37.021 --> 00:47:38.977
First you have to save it.


00:47:41.067 --> 00:47:42.853
We're overdue for that interview.


00:47:45.571 --> 00:47:47.152
Maybe when this is over.


00:47:47.239 --> 00:47:48.239
